WEBVTT

00:27.620 --> 00:29.610
"I thought I told you not to come in here!"

00:30.130 --> 00:32.560
"Do you want that to happen to you?!"

00:34.530 --> 00:36.790
"He's my child."

00:37.530 --> 00:40.370
"I will raise him by my own hand."

00:57.750 --> 01:04.090
It's only natural that my parents feared the unfortunate curse I had from birth

01:04.090 --> 01:07.260
of breaking the tools I used.

01:18.910 --> 01:23.280
All the books I enjoyed crumbled as I read them.

01:23.280 --> 01:26.410
And I hardly ever touched anyone.

01:26.410 --> 01:31.820
I wonder what would have happened if I'd handled someone like a tool.

01:35.590 --> 01:43.860
Once counted among the richest in D'natia, my family was headed to ruin before I knew it.

01:48.440 --> 01:50.000
Shark.

01:59.210 --> 02:01.680
I won't touch you, I promise.

02:11.130 --> 02:16.130
When I lost my close friend, that's when I finally understood...

02:16.130 --> 02:21.870
Tools can be broken, and lives lost, even if I don't come in contact with them.

02:21.870 --> 02:25.400
That was what I took as truth in this world.

02:32.580 --> 02:35.910
I heard rumors of the Clazzvali Family's fall.

02:45.990 --> 02:49.930
His suffering should end on this island.

02:49.930 --> 02:53.740
Are you referring to his contract with Black Dragon?

02:53.740 --> 02:55.840
So long as his bad habit doesn't surface...

02:55.840 --> 02:57.330
Bad habit?

02:58.570 --> 03:01.210
The name of this island is Nil Kamui.

03:01.210 --> 03:03.440
The land where the great and ancient country Kouran

03:03.440 --> 03:06.710
and our homeland, D'natia, are in conflict for supremacy.

03:08.180 --> 03:12.450
Empire Era 285, September...

03:12.450 --> 03:15.590
The great ancient country, Kouran...

03:15.590 --> 03:18.690
...our country, D'natia...

03:18.690 --> 03:21.600
...and the revolutionary army representing Nil Kamui

03:21.600 --> 03:24.700
came together to form the Red Dragon expedition,

03:24.700 --> 03:28.240
whose ranks I joined.

03:28.240 --> 03:31.370
All so that I can part ways with my absurd fate.

03:32.370 --> 03:37.150
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

03:37.150 --> 03:41.580
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

03:41.580 --> 03:43.710
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

03:54.500 --> 04:03.840
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

04:03.840 --> 04:04.840
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

04:04.840 --> 04:06.940
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

04:06.940 --> 04:10.010
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

04:10.010 --> 04:12.250
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

04:12.250 --> 04:14.450
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

04:14.450 --> 04:18.690
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

04:18.690 --> 04:24.930
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

04:24.930 --> 04:30.430
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

04:30.430 --> 04:35.500
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

04:35.500 --> 04:41.180
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

04:41.180 --> 04:46.780
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

04:46.780 --> 04:50.820
<i>The ending world</i>

04:50.820 --> 04:55.690
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

05:02.960 --> 05:06.230
"Ogani Volcano"

05:07.970 --> 05:11.460
It's me! You remember me, don't you?!

05:38.770 --> 05:40.700
Hien...

05:40.700 --> 05:43.170
The Child of Contract...

05:43.170 --> 05:44.610
Get a hold of yourself!

05:44.610 --> 05:47.540
You're a mighty warrior of the Hyakki Force!

05:55.020 --> 05:56.850
He's a Returned One now...

05:58.890 --> 06:03.950
I will sacrifice anything in the name of the one to become king.

06:08.030 --> 06:10.020
Wait for me...

06:19.610 --> 06:22.540
Let's hit it four times, shall we?

06:24.610 --> 06:26.210
Pò Shàn!

06:34.590 --> 06:36.420
What nectar, Lou!

06:36.420 --> 06:40.660
Never before have I savored such a soul as that.

06:42.060 --> 06:45.330
That is quite pleasing to hear.

06:46.770 --> 06:48.900
Izun...

06:48.900 --> 06:51.610
Izun, can you hear me?!

06:51.610 --> 06:54.340
I'm one of the Imperials, Ibuki!

06:57.250 --> 06:58.740
Ibuki!

07:10.860 --> 07:12.660
Are you really Izun...?

07:26.810 --> 07:28.140
There...!

07:28.140 --> 07:29.970
How's that?

07:31.310 --> 07:33.210
What are you trying to do here?

07:33.210 --> 07:35.020
Ibuki...

07:35.020 --> 07:36.980
Uh, Sir Ibuki, was it?

07:36.980 --> 07:40.150
I'm trying to buy him time so that he can try to talk sense into him.

07:40.150 --> 07:45.130
Once a person becomes a Returned One, they will never regain their sanity.

07:45.130 --> 07:46.890
So it is with Izun.

07:48.800 --> 07:51.160
Um, what are you planning to do?

07:52.370 --> 07:57.570
I will offer my life to bring down the Stone Giant.

07:57.570 --> 08:01.530
I don't think he'll comply with your wish...

08:10.320 --> 08:14.550
I don't need to borrow my lord's power for this!

08:15.560 --> 08:17.050
Fēng Zhăn!

08:27.000 --> 08:30.560
So that's the power of a Black Dragon Knight...

08:47.620 --> 08:49.250
Ibuki!

08:57.530 --> 09:01.100
Those kids still have room to grow.

09:01.100 --> 09:07.740
They need to be protected by someone until their time to break arrives.

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
"Dragon \ The dragons are the primordial

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
beings of this world. According to the oldest

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
of records, they were depicted upon painted

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
walls during the hunting period of more

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
than 3,000 years ago. Seen and counted

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
as gods, they are said to hold powers

09:25.890 --> 09:29.630
that could easily destroy a small country."

09:33.270 --> 09:35.800
What is this...?

09:35.800 --> 09:37.290
My lord?

10:00.360 --> 10:03.000
Lady Meryl...?

10:03.000 --> 10:05.630
It was back when he was ten years old...

10:07.640 --> 10:12.600
He insisted on a Mixed One as a slave.

10:13.840 --> 10:18.210
Supposedly, Bound Ones and Mixed Ones didn't age...

10:18.210 --> 10:20.620
...so they wouldn't break.

10:20.620 --> 10:22.680
Or at least that's what he thought.

10:25.150 --> 10:31.960
That Mixed One wasn't brought in as a slave, but was instead adopted by a steward.

10:36.960 --> 10:43.870
Years later, she was involved in a kidnapping, which left her on the verge of death...

10:48.010 --> 10:49.980
I see.

10:52.310 --> 10:56.840
So, that peculiar phenomenon of yours drew me here.

10:58.650 --> 11:01.720
Do you wish to save her?

11:01.720 --> 11:03.210
Yes!

11:04.830 --> 11:09.590
If so, then I will shift her wounds onto you.

11:16.440 --> 11:19.510
All things go to ruin without exception.

11:19.510 --> 11:22.000
He knows that very well, and yet...

11:25.110 --> 11:26.910
Such a bad habit...

11:29.050 --> 11:30.540
Val!

11:48.940 --> 11:50.430
Izun!

12:14.430 --> 12:16.950
I'll absorb all that it has!

12:33.180 --> 12:35.850
It's still full of life!

12:35.850 --> 12:37.420
I'm truly sorry!

12:37.420 --> 12:40.750
I will protect you, my lord!

12:44.630 --> 12:46.120
Lou!

12:51.000 --> 12:53.530
Izun...

12:53.530 --> 12:55.970
I'll kill you...

12:55.970 --> 12:58.170
I'll follow you shortly after.

13:01.510 --> 13:04.450
If she keeps that up, Eykha will kill Izun...

13:05.450 --> 13:08.020
Killing a friend...

13:08.020 --> 13:11.120
No one else...

13:11.120 --> 13:12.780
...needs to go through that!

13:14.790 --> 13:16.860
Ibuki!

13:16.860 --> 13:18.350
Hien!

13:20.130 --> 13:22.560
He turned into a Returned One?!

13:28.840 --> 13:30.240
Hien...

13:30.240 --> 13:31.800
You too...?

13:42.820 --> 13:45.020
Please kill me...

13:45.020 --> 13:47.190
I'm sorry...

13:47.190 --> 13:50.590
I'll offer you as a sacrifice to Red Dragon!

13:57.870 --> 13:59.500
Hurry...

13:59.500 --> 14:01.870
Red Dragon's power...

14:01.870 --> 14:03.040
Hien...!

14:03.040 --> 14:04.270
His sanity...

14:04.270 --> 14:08.540
No, he wasn't a Returned One in the first place?!

14:08.540 --> 14:09.680
No...!

14:09.680 --> 14:12.880
Then, those eyes were...?!

14:16.020 --> 14:19.090
If I wasn't a Returned One...

14:19.090 --> 14:23.620
...you would not have used my life, Lord Ibuki...

14:26.730 --> 14:29.390
You are a kind person, after all...

14:31.730 --> 14:35.470
What of Red Dragon...?

14:35.470 --> 14:38.530
Hurry, the Stone Giant must be...

14:40.880 --> 14:44.110
Red Dragon, the offering has been made.

14:44.110 --> 14:46.380
Lend me your flames!

14:49.150 --> 14:54.380
Finally, you will use... my life to...

14:57.220 --> 14:59.330
Red Dragon! Your power!

14:59.330 --> 15:01.100
Lend me your power!

15:01.100 --> 15:02.400
Hien!

15:02.400 --> 15:06.600
I offered Hien's life...!
I offered it to you just now!

15:06.600 --> 15:08.270
Answer me!

15:08.270 --> 15:10.570
Please answer me!

15:14.010 --> 15:18.350
Ibuki, we need to get out of here!

15:18.350 --> 15:20.150
Why...?

15:20.150 --> 15:23.180
The Dragon Eye isn't shining...

15:23.180 --> 15:24.590
That means...

15:24.590 --> 15:29.160
...Hien's life isn't considered to be an equivalent exchange.

15:29.160 --> 15:32.090
I suppose that's the line of reasoning.

15:32.090 --> 15:33.960
But...

15:33.960 --> 15:37.860
I was told to offer those precious to me...

15:41.440 --> 15:43.940
S-Sweallow...?

15:43.940 --> 15:49.640
Don't worry... I've got something I need to do.

15:49.640 --> 15:55.780
I knew Hien wasn't a Returned One...

15:55.780 --> 15:59.720
None of the other
Returned Ones were moving at all.

15:59.720 --> 16:04.560
But there was no way I could tell them about the Black Dragon's Scale...

16:04.560 --> 16:06.890
Because of that, Hien...

16:08.800 --> 16:11.320
All of this is my sin to bear...

16:12.230 --> 16:14.720
"Months ago

16:12.230 --> 16:14.720
D'natia \ Clazzvali family manor"

16:19.970 --> 16:22.080
Please don't touch.

16:22.080 --> 16:24.010
At least let me get some tea.

16:24.010 --> 16:25.550
No.

16:25.550 --> 16:30.710
This mansion and all its belongings are under seizure by the Sherbet Company.

16:32.250 --> 16:35.420
I really appreciate it, my dear creditor.

16:35.420 --> 16:41.530
You're about the only one to support the bankrupt Clazzvali Family.

16:41.530 --> 16:45.700
By the way, it's about time, Sir Sweallow.

16:45.700 --> 16:48.070
Do I really have to go?

16:51.110 --> 16:53.070
Oh, all right, I'll go...

16:55.840 --> 16:59.780
"Hours later...

16:55.840 --> 16:59.780
D'natia \ Shrine of the Black Dragon"

17:26.740 --> 17:29.080
I see.

17:29.080 --> 17:34.050
I suppose it can be called a curse of destruction.

17:34.050 --> 17:37.420
It's exactly how you saw it, Black Dragon.

17:37.420 --> 17:40.590
Do you wish to remove that curse?

17:40.590 --> 17:42.720
If possible.

17:42.720 --> 17:47.390
As you can tell, it's just absurd living with this.

17:47.390 --> 17:54.600
You are aware that one of the Seven Dragons,
Red Dragon, resides in Nil Kamui, yes?

17:54.600 --> 17:58.510
That one, Red Dragon, has gone mad.

17:58.510 --> 18:02.580
I want you to join the combined expedition among the three countries...

18:02.580 --> 18:08.180
...and exterminate Red Dragon with your very own hands.

18:08.180 --> 18:11.920
Is that the condition placed on the removal of my curse?

18:11.920 --> 18:18.660
The scar placed upon you shall again seal your contract with me.

18:27.940 --> 18:31.130
This scar saved Meryl...

18:33.440 --> 18:35.340
I have nothing else to say.

18:35.340 --> 18:41.710
I appoint you, Sweallow Clazzvali, to the Black Dragon Knights.

18:55.530 --> 18:57.660
Contract seal, release!

18:57.660 --> 18:59.830
I bring the tyranny of Black Dragon!

19:08.580 --> 19:14.210
This power is supposed to be saved for finishing off Red Dragon...

19:14.210 --> 19:17.680
But this is my sin too...

19:17.680 --> 19:19.350
Black Blade...

19:22.560 --> 19:26.930
My contract and your curse are connected.

19:26.930 --> 19:32.090
When differing powers of humans and dragons come together as one...

19:36.740 --> 19:38.670
Izun...!

19:51.350 --> 19:55.120
I know of the Black Blade which the Black Dragon Knights use,

19:55.120 --> 19:57.860
but that is not quite the same...

19:57.860 --> 20:01.520
I can't believe how graciously he uses his swords to ruin...

20:03.200 --> 20:05.870
I wonder how he would use me.

20:05.870 --> 20:07.370
My lord...

20:07.370 --> 20:16.440
My greatest joy is to offer all of the living blood flowing within me to you, my lord...

20:22.320 --> 20:25.890
Ibuki, are you okay?

20:25.890 --> 20:30.720
I... couldn't kill Izun.

20:30.720 --> 20:32.220
Ibuki?

20:34.230 --> 20:36.230
I•••

20:36.230 --> 20:38.220
Hien...

20:42.170 --> 20:47.640
It seems as if this is the clue that my friend Red Dragon has left behind.

20:47.640 --> 20:52.340
I suppose it's only fair that the rights to it belong to Sweallow.

20:54.410 --> 20:59.510
I recall an ancient legend saying that only dragons can kill dragons.

21:00.790 --> 21:03.320
Hello...

21:03.320 --> 21:07.160
Excuse me, but it seems something odd is happening in Haiga.

21:07.160 --> 21:09.930
Haiga, you say?

21:09.930 --> 21:13.800
Ah, um... Hello, Shaddy?

21:13.800 --> 21:18.810
Ah, Lord Ka Grava!
D'natia's bishop is in the city, and...!

21:18.810 --> 21:20.940
Why don't you send an image to me?

21:20.940 --> 21:22.840
Ah, yes!

21:22.840 --> 21:25.850
Behold, citizens of Nil Kamui!

21:25.850 --> 21:29.980
The one you see here is the true Imperial of Nil Kamui!

21:29.980 --> 21:32.620
The one to become queen!

21:32.620 --> 21:34.950
Lady Inori!

21:36.660 --> 21:37.690
Inori?!

21:37.690 --> 21:39.390
Do you know her?

21:40.860 --> 21:43.300
She's...

21:43.300 --> 21:45.030
...my younger sister.

21:45.970 --> 21:46.400
"Act 7"

21:47.370 --> 21:50.670
"Act 7 \ Ups and Downs in Life"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.970 --> 23:27.430
"Act 8"

23:27.230 --> 23:31.610
Act 8: "Perfect Serenity."

23:31.610 --> 23:36.240
Inori's return releases Ibuki from his fate.

23:36.240 --> 23:40.080
Who is it that doesn't want that to happen?
